WEBVTT

01:30.360 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:37.720 --> 01:38.560
A little further up.

01:39.120 --> 01:39.960
Okay.

01:42.160 --> 01:43.960
-Now?
-Yeah. Almost.

01:44.040 --> 01:45.360
-That's it.
-That'll do.

01:45.440 --> 01:47.360
DOUBLE HAPPINESS

01:53.360 --> 01:55.800
Today is our wedding day.

01:56.840 --> 01:59.640
A funeral for a wedding.
You're really crazy.

02:00.160 --> 02:01.560
Isn't it good?

02:03.080 --> 02:06.720
It's what she wants and what I want.

02:08.720 --> 02:11.920
Do you really think
you'll get what both of you want?

02:12.000 --> 02:15.800
I can tell you
there's no love between you.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.440
You're just torturing each other.

02:19.480 --> 02:22.360
Who says that only people
who love each other can get married

02:22.440 --> 02:25.200
or that people who get married
must love each other?

02:27.000 --> 02:29.920
Love is fleeting and fragile.

02:30.720 --> 02:32.640
Time can defeat it,

02:33.160 --> 02:36.960
as can money and death.

02:39.000 --> 02:43.280
If you want eternity, you can't have love.

02:46.280 --> 02:47.280
Feng Yao.

02:49.160 --> 02:51.000
Will you be the hostess of my wedding?

02:51.080 --> 02:52.360
I'm not interested.

02:55.760 --> 02:59.080
You once told me fate was irrevocable

02:59.160 --> 03:00.360
and advised me not to force it,

03:01.040 --> 03:04.200
but now, you're forcing it.

03:10.000 --> 03:13.440
But how do you know
this moment isn't fate?

03:13.960 --> 03:17.160
I can't stop you if that's what you want,

03:18.000 --> 03:21.160
but I'm not going to be a part
of this travesty.

03:23.040 --> 03:24.080
Do what you want.

03:29.000 --> 03:35.960
GREENVIEW HEIGHTS

03:46.040 --> 03:50.680
ELEVEN YEARS AGO

04:03.960 --> 04:07.440
GREENVIEW HEIGHTS

04:20.920 --> 04:23.080
You've been kneeling here for three days.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.880
Why so stubborn?

04:28.360 --> 04:32.200
Please give me spirit medicines
and let me save my brother.

04:33.400 --> 04:35.040
I don't want to refuse you,

04:35.120 --> 04:36.800
but even if I give it to you,
it will be useless.

04:39.240 --> 04:41.120
I did a divination for you.

04:41.840 --> 04:44.400
I learned that your kinship is at an end.

04:46.280 --> 04:47.520
This is fate.

04:52.480 --> 04:54.920
What if this fate happens to you?

04:55.000 --> 04:55.840
Would you be able to accept it?

04:56.600 --> 04:59.520
I learned my fate long ago.

05:01.680 --> 05:05.720
One day soon, I will lose everything,

05:07.720 --> 05:09.640
but I don't intend to run away

05:10.840 --> 05:14.280
because running away is also within fate.

05:15.720 --> 05:19.120
Even so, I want to try my best.

05:19.200 --> 05:20.680
Please give me the medicine.

05:23.840 --> 05:24.880
Ten years.

05:24.960 --> 05:27.280
I'll be loyal to you for ten years.

05:27.800 --> 05:29.720
If you do lose everything,

05:31.120 --> 05:34.280
I'll stay with you and never leave you.

05:41.280 --> 05:42.520
It's been six months,

05:43.840 --> 05:44.760
but you don't seem well.

05:45.520 --> 05:46.840
Yuan is dead.

05:48.000 --> 05:49.200
In the past six months,

05:50.760 --> 05:52.760
spirit medicines cured him

05:54.040 --> 05:55.880
but attracted an evil cultivator
who stole the medicine

05:56.720 --> 05:58.480
and sucked his blood to death.

05:59.600 --> 06:01.200
I killed the evil cultivator
to avenge his death,

06:02.360 --> 06:03.960
but I couldn't save my brother.

06:05.280 --> 06:08.960
If I hadn't begged for spirit medicines,

06:09.720 --> 06:12.040
it wouldn't have attracted
the evil cultivator,

06:12.880 --> 06:15.680
and my brother wouldn't have died.

06:17.240 --> 06:19.120
-Am I--
-Still the same.

06:20.840 --> 06:22.200
It's fate.

06:29.520 --> 06:30.640
It seems

06:32.120 --> 06:33.680
your destiny has arrived.

06:38.000 --> 06:39.320
A month ago,

06:40.040 --> 06:42.360
my father killed my stepmother

06:43.640 --> 06:45.880
but kept my brother
who plotted against me.

06:47.440 --> 06:48.360
Do you hate them?

06:52.920 --> 06:54.320
Their fate

06:56.720 --> 06:58.720
and the fate of Greenview Heights

07:00.880 --> 07:02.480
are about to be fulfilled.

07:06.480 --> 07:09.640
Then, today is the first day
of the next ten years.

07:13.640 --> 07:14.640
My name is Feng Yao.

07:15.760 --> 07:18.880
Feng means sealing,
and Yao means distance.

07:24.320 --> 07:27.320
Ten years have passed,
and people have changed.

07:28.200 --> 07:31.360
Feng Yao, why don't you leave?

07:37.640 --> 07:39.760
This new demon is so strong

07:40.600 --> 07:42.720
that he can tear through
the Immortals Array by himself.

07:44.000 --> 07:46.800
If there is such a guy in the Dark Abyss,
why did Sang Qi work

07:46.880 --> 07:48.240
with the Decaying Immortal Pavilion
in the first place?

08:01.000 --> 08:01.840
Xuechen?

08:06.520 --> 08:08.160
It's not that simple.

08:09.080 --> 08:11.200
He's covered in demonic energy,

08:11.840 --> 08:13.280
but he doesn't look like
he's possessed by the Dark Clan.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.800
Xuechen.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.240
Why did you come out of the Dark Abyss?

08:16.320 --> 08:18.040
What happened?

08:18.560 --> 08:21.320
How can a piece of trash
like Xie Xuechen, who died so easily,

08:21.840 --> 08:23.840
be compared to me?

08:23.920 --> 08:26.000
Mr. Xie is dead?

08:26.080 --> 08:28.200
Then who is he?

08:29.360 --> 08:30.720
My senior was born with ten channels

08:30.800 --> 08:32.640
and is the strongest of Humans.

08:33.159 --> 08:34.159
Who can kill him?

08:35.320 --> 08:36.640
No one in the world can kill him.

08:37.320 --> 08:39.000
Since this new demon has the power
to break the Immortals Array,

08:39.880 --> 08:43.600
maybe he killed Mr. Xie
and took Mr. Xie's body.

08:43.679 --> 08:45.440
Stupid.

08:49.320 --> 08:51.320
No. This is Xuechen's technique.

08:51.400 --> 08:52.240
You are Xuechen.

08:53.000 --> 08:55.840
Xie Xuechen is nothing more
than one of my souls

08:55.920 --> 08:57.400
and has been fused by me,

08:58.240 --> 09:00.360
so how hard can it be
to use his technique?

09:00.440 --> 09:02.640
But I want to know

09:03.480 --> 09:06.960
how strong your so-called strongest
of Humans really is.

09:07.680 --> 09:09.120
Spell. Everyone, be on guard.

09:27.200 --> 09:28.720
Xie Xuechen is trash,

09:29.240 --> 09:32.200
and the Immortal Alliance
is worse than trash.

09:32.760 --> 09:36.520
How can people like you protect the world?

09:36.600 --> 09:39.560
With such little power as yours?

09:41.920 --> 09:46.040
It's always boring
when the game ends too soon.

09:47.080 --> 09:49.400
I will spare your lives today,

09:50.320 --> 09:51.560
but remember.

09:51.640 --> 09:53.880
Xie Xuechen is dead,

09:54.880 --> 09:59.080
and the Immortal Alliance now
exists in name only.

10:27.680 --> 10:33.960
DOUBLE HAPPINESS

10:36.200 --> 10:39.880
Mortal weddings require us
to worship heaven and earth,

10:41.000 --> 10:44.880
but I am heaven, and you are earth,

10:44.960 --> 10:46.720
so we don't need to do that.

10:48.360 --> 10:49.680
Then we have to worship our parents,

10:50.960 --> 10:53.360
yet everything is born in chaos,

10:54.840 --> 10:58.520
and you and I don't have parents,
so we don't need to do that.

11:04.800 --> 11:06.720
The only thing that will be
a commitment for you and me

11:08.360 --> 11:10.160
to be together for eternity
is to worship each other

11:10.240 --> 11:12.440
as husband and wife.

11:13.320 --> 11:15.280
Don't force me to hate you more.

11:18.600 --> 11:21.080
In fact, you've hated me for a long time,

11:22.440 --> 11:27.080
but you don't even remember your hate.

11:32.160 --> 11:33.200
Come on.

12:12.160 --> 12:14.800
Why don't you duck?

12:15.600 --> 12:18.160
I knew you'd be like this today,

12:19.320 --> 12:21.760
but I wanted to try

12:21.840 --> 12:24.320
and finish the wedding with you.

12:26.320 --> 12:30.040
I was supposed to have nothing
and be alone,

12:30.880 --> 12:32.560
so those who are greedy

12:34.000 --> 12:35.880
must pay the price.

12:48.880 --> 12:50.320
I have lied to you

12:51.680 --> 12:52.880
and hurt you,

12:53.960 --> 12:54.960
so this jab

12:56.160 --> 12:57.960
is your vent.

13:02.200 --> 13:04.040
Do you think that makes it even?

13:18.800 --> 13:19.880
No.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.560
You can hate me

13:27.600 --> 13:29.160
or kill me,

13:30.880 --> 13:32.920
but I hope you and I

13:34.320 --> 13:35.440
are never even.

14:18.280 --> 14:20.400
What a show.

14:21.360 --> 14:23.720
Whose funeral are you organizing?

14:30.320 --> 14:32.360
-Zhao Ming.
-Xie Xuechen.

14:32.880 --> 14:34.480
Isn't this the Divine Emperor of Fate?

14:34.560 --> 14:37.160
I didn't realize you'd fallen
into the mortal world

14:37.680 --> 14:39.400
and become distracted
by mundane matters and mortal love.

14:40.040 --> 14:41.200
This is ridiculous.

14:41.280 --> 14:43.720
It seems that Xie Xuechen's soul

14:44.240 --> 14:46.280
has returned to your body.

14:47.120 --> 14:47.960
What did you say?

14:49.160 --> 14:50.560
Why so surprised?

14:51.800 --> 14:53.240
I told you.

14:54.080 --> 14:56.640
Xie Xuechen is just one of my souls.

14:56.720 --> 14:58.600
You devoured him?

15:02.720 --> 15:06.840
It was his honor to be fused with me.

15:07.360 --> 15:11.280
Now it's not him you should worry about

15:11.800 --> 15:13.280
but yourself.

15:23.040 --> 15:24.600
You're like this now,

15:25.680 --> 15:27.000
so who can you protect?

15:27.080 --> 15:29.360
I've fallen into the mortal world,

15:30.040 --> 15:31.920
but I'm still Fate.

15:32.000 --> 15:33.480
So ridiculous.

16:04.720 --> 16:06.840
Is an immortal with
a mortal heart still an immortal?

16:06.920 --> 16:09.240
Your divine essence has become impure,
and your power diminished.

16:09.840 --> 16:12.040
You are no longer
the Divine Emperor of Fate.

16:12.120 --> 16:14.440
Since we've been friends for 10,000 years,

16:15.320 --> 16:19.160
I'll make it quick to help you out.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.840
You saved him?

16:42.920 --> 16:44.440
How dare you?

16:45.400 --> 16:46.400
I didn't save him.

16:46.480 --> 16:47.640
I just didn't want you
to get what you want.

16:49.200 --> 16:50.880
You hurt Xie Xuechen,

16:52.440 --> 16:54.360
so I will never let you go.

16:55.280 --> 16:58.080
Fate's existence is a threat to you.

16:58.160 --> 16:59.920
I will never let you do

17:00.880 --> 17:02.560
what you want.

17:06.160 --> 17:07.920
Then I'll show you

17:09.280 --> 17:11.200
how I get what I want.

17:30.720 --> 17:32.160
Xie Xuechen.

17:32.720 --> 17:35.560
How dare you bind me
with Jade Vault Technique in your soul?

17:36.080 --> 17:38.480
Do you think that will limit me?

17:43.040 --> 17:44.400
After 10,000 years,

17:45.400 --> 17:47.840
you are still with Fate,

17:48.800 --> 17:53.080
but now, I'm not merciful anymore.

17:54.560 --> 17:58.480
SECLUDED IN WOODS AND VALLEYS

18:07.000 --> 18:08.160
Sleep.

18:08.680 --> 18:10.280
Sleep well.

18:11.640 --> 18:15.960
When you wake up,
I'll tell you everything.

18:41.160 --> 18:42.880
This is the price you pay
for insisting on marrying her.

18:45.280 --> 18:47.680
-I'll give you medicine.
-No need.

18:49.480 --> 18:52.120
Ordinary spirit medicines are useless
for wounds inflicted

18:52.720 --> 18:54.080
by the blades of the Chaos Power.

18:55.760 --> 18:57.880
Then what will cure you? I'll find it.

19:00.760 --> 19:02.560
I thought you said you weren't involved.

19:04.920 --> 19:06.800
But I didn't say
I don't care about your life.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.080
Don't worry.

19:10.680 --> 19:11.920
I won't die.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.360
It's just that this wound won't heal.

19:16.000 --> 19:19.040
If you can control karma
and see through the world,

19:19.920 --> 19:22.000
why are you so stubborn about her?

19:23.720 --> 19:24.760
Feng Yao.

19:26.760 --> 19:30.040
Do you know how long
tens of thousands of years are?

19:31.360 --> 19:34.920
Very few people in this world
are over 100 years old,

19:35.440 --> 19:38.200
and cultivators live
at most a thousand years,

19:38.800 --> 19:40.960
so I can't answer your question.

19:41.600 --> 19:43.400
To the immortal,

19:44.520 --> 19:47.360
tens of thousands of years
is a very long time.

19:49.560 --> 19:53.840
Long enough for the world
to change several times.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.840
In the world of the immortal,
I was very lonely.

19:55.920 --> 19:57.360
During those years,

19:57.440 --> 20:00.840
only she and I accompanied each other.

20:01.920 --> 20:03.880
Anyway, I had you by my side.

20:05.320 --> 20:06.720
No matter how the sun and moon change,

20:06.800 --> 20:07.840
no matter if this is
the universe or the foreworld,

20:09.360 --> 20:10.280
Fate,

20:11.400 --> 20:13.120
we'll always be together.

20:14.240 --> 20:16.360
I just want to go back in time.

20:19.960 --> 20:20.800
Ten thousand years is too long.

20:21.600 --> 20:22.960
The world has changed too much.

20:23.640 --> 20:26.240
Mu Xuanling is not the same
as the Chaos Pearl.

20:32.880 --> 20:33.760
What about you?

20:34.880 --> 20:39.200
Can you tell Nan Xuyue from Fate?

20:41.640 --> 20:43.400
If you can't let go of her,

20:43.920 --> 20:45.760
why don't you use the Book of Fate
to change her fate

20:46.760 --> 20:47.880
in order to make
her fall in love with you?

20:51.240 --> 20:53.360
Because Hao Tian
doesn't allow divine artifacts

20:55.480 --> 20:56.760
to have love.

20:57.800 --> 20:58.640
Hao Tian.

21:16.760 --> 21:18.200
Fate.

21:18.720 --> 21:21.280
You have spent tens of thousands of years

21:21.360 --> 21:23.200
and had hundreds
of centuries of punishment,

21:23.280 --> 21:24.960
so, do you realize your mistake?

21:26.200 --> 21:27.240
Yes.

21:28.400 --> 21:30.960
I shouldn't have disobeyed you back then.

21:32.720 --> 21:34.280
All these years of torment

21:35.400 --> 21:37.160
have been my own doing.

21:38.080 --> 21:39.760
All things are in order

21:39.840 --> 21:42.440
because they follow the laws of Hao Tian.

21:42.520 --> 21:44.560
You are Fate, the divine artifact,

21:44.640 --> 21:50.080
so bloodshed and injuries
should not happen to you.

21:56.360 --> 21:57.880
Thank you, Hao Tian.

21:57.960 --> 22:00.440
The sudden appearance
of the new Demon Lord

22:00.520 --> 22:03.240
and the changes to Hao Tian's rules

22:03.320 --> 22:05.960
will disrupt the course of the world.

22:06.560 --> 22:10.240
But the Book of Fate
can't change a person's destiny twice.

22:10.320 --> 22:14.080
I can't come down to the world directly.

22:14.160 --> 22:15.120
Fate,

22:15.200 --> 22:17.360
I need you to do my will

22:17.440 --> 22:19.080
and continue to accomplish

22:19.160 --> 22:21.120
what you failed to do 10,000 years ago.

22:21.200 --> 22:24.960
This time, don't let me down.

22:25.040 --> 22:26.920
Aye, Hao Tian.

22:30.240 --> 22:32.840
Leader. I have arranged
for the injured disciples

22:32.920 --> 22:34.760
of the general factions to heal

22:35.280 --> 22:36.640
in quarters
with the best spirit medicines.

22:36.720 --> 22:38.040
Thank you, Elder Cang.

22:39.800 --> 22:40.880
I've sent spiritual flowers
and spiritual grass

22:40.960 --> 22:42.560
from the Mirage Palace here.

22:42.640 --> 22:43.560
I hope that helps.

22:45.480 --> 22:47.480
Humans and spirits have made an alliance,

22:47.560 --> 22:49.640
but now, it seems that we are no match
for the new Demon Lord.

22:49.720 --> 22:50.680
Guys,

22:51.920 --> 22:55.800
that new Demon Lord
does look similar to Mr. Xie.

22:55.880 --> 22:58.920
That day, Mr. Xie left this place
and never came back.

22:59.600 --> 23:03.000
If what the new Demon Lord said

23:03.080 --> 23:04.360
-is true…
-No.

23:05.000 --> 23:05.920
Don't get carried away.

23:06.840 --> 23:07.920
That's right.

23:08.000 --> 23:09.640
The most important thing
is to discuss what to do.

23:10.600 --> 23:13.120
Regardless of the new Demon Lord's origin,

23:13.200 --> 23:15.080
it is now a fact that the Immortals Array
has been torn apart.

23:15.880 --> 23:17.960
In order to prevent the Dark Clan
from attacking the Humans,

23:18.480 --> 23:21.040
I will lead the Xuantian Sect disciples

23:21.120 --> 23:22.560
to study the Exorcism Array from today.

23:23.080 --> 23:25.520
I hope that all sects
will strengthen your protection.

23:25.600 --> 23:26.520
-Yes.
-Yes.

23:35.120 --> 23:36.040
Your Grace.

23:36.120 --> 23:37.800
This is the Soul-Stealing Gu
of the Lava, right?

23:37.880 --> 23:39.120
The Soul-Stealing Gu?

23:39.640 --> 23:40.920
Isn't that the gadget

23:41.000 --> 23:42.640
that He Xianwo
used to turn the cultivators

23:42.720 --> 23:44.040
of the Mirage Palace into puppets?

23:44.640 --> 23:48.160
That gu worm cost the user's life

23:48.240 --> 23:50.400
and only worked after the user's death.

23:50.480 --> 23:53.520
Your Grace, this gu butterfly
looks different.

23:53.600 --> 23:55.960
The gu butterfly doesn't require anything

23:57.360 --> 23:59.160
to turn anyone into a demon.

23:59.240 --> 24:01.480
It's amazing how powerful
a little butterfly can be.

24:01.560 --> 24:02.840
So, Your Grace,

24:03.360 --> 24:07.000
when are we going to kill
the Immortal Alliance's cultivators?

24:07.960 --> 24:12.200
Killing the Immortal Alliance is as easy
as crushing a bunch of ants,

24:13.400 --> 24:17.520
so, it's far less interesting
to slaughter than to torture.

24:19.400 --> 24:20.760
Xie Xuechen.

24:21.640 --> 24:23.880
So what if you put a limit on me?

24:24.400 --> 24:28.640
I can still destroy the world
you want to protect.

24:53.720 --> 24:55.200
It's a bit chilly in the morning.

24:55.280 --> 24:57.160
Go sleep some more.

24:59.120 --> 25:02.880
I only helped you yesterday
to deal with the Demon Lord.

25:02.960 --> 25:04.840
That doesn't mean I forgive you.

25:07.600 --> 25:10.480
I hate the Demon Lord, as well as you.

25:11.440 --> 25:14.280
I know you won't forgive me,

25:15.560 --> 25:16.680
but I also know

25:17.680 --> 25:18.920
that you don't want everything

25:19.000 --> 25:21.360
Xie Xuechen is guarding
to be destroyed by the Demon Lord.

25:22.800 --> 25:25.680
I have been feuding
with Demon Lord for 10,000 years.

25:26.320 --> 25:28.440
Since you and I have the same goal,

25:29.160 --> 25:31.200
why can't we work together for once?

25:33.200 --> 25:34.400
Why should I do that?

25:35.760 --> 25:39.800
Because I know Demon Lord's weakness
and how to deal with it.

25:41.440 --> 25:42.600
Weakness?

25:45.800 --> 25:46.680
It's Pearl.

25:49.880 --> 25:52.840
What happened 10,000 years ago?

25:55.320 --> 25:56.840
Things have changed.

25:58.080 --> 26:01.600
You and Xie Xuechen,
Pearl, and the Demon Lord,

26:02.560 --> 26:04.440
all started by chance 10,000 years ago.

26:05.080 --> 26:08.520
If you want to know the truth
and find a way to break it,

26:08.600 --> 26:10.800
why don't you experience it for yourself?

26:12.600 --> 26:16.040
I can open the Fate Array for you
to bring back the events

26:17.120 --> 26:19.520
of 10,000 years ago

26:19.600 --> 26:22.960
and let you experience them again
from Pearl's point of view.

26:25.240 --> 26:26.080
Would you dare?

26:28.640 --> 26:29.680
Why wouldn't I?

26:32.520 --> 26:34.320
I have no memories of the Chaos Pearl,

26:34.960 --> 26:36.280
so the only thing I believe in

26:37.240 --> 26:40.160
is the tens of thousands of years
you spent together.

26:41.720 --> 26:43.320
Tens of thousands of years
is not a long time

26:43.840 --> 26:45.640
for normal people to imagine.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.880
It's not you,

26:51.840 --> 26:53.240
but us.

27:02.480 --> 27:03.840
I'll wait for you

27:06.080 --> 27:07.360
to return with the memories.

27:20.160 --> 27:23.200
At the beginning of the primordial chaos,
Hao Tian created the world

27:23.920 --> 27:25.840
and invented two divine artifacts,

27:26.360 --> 27:28.640
the Chaos Pearl and the Book of Fate.

27:30.960 --> 27:34.600
The Chaos Pearl governs time and space,
and the Book of Fate governs karma.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.840
Both are controlled by Hao Tian

27:40.000 --> 27:42.120
and work together
to keep the world running.

27:44.760 --> 27:47.080
After that, there are
various races and creatures.

27:49.720 --> 27:53.560
Everything in the world
follows the law of Hao Tian.

28:21.760 --> 28:22.720
Ten thousand years ago,

28:22.800 --> 28:24.720
-the Divine Clan had a civil war.
-You…

28:24.800 --> 28:26.640
The evil immortal Jun Yu led a rebellion,

28:26.720 --> 28:28.720
killed the faction
of the good old Immortal Emperor,

28:28.800 --> 28:31.040
and took over the rule
of the Celestial Realm.

28:31.760 --> 28:33.680
Shocked by the war in the Divine Clan,

28:33.760 --> 28:36.280
the sky shook and cracked,

28:36.880 --> 28:38.520
bringing the three realms
to the brink of collapse,

28:38.600 --> 28:41.440
known as the Catastrophe of Cang Hao.

28:43.080 --> 28:45.240
Hao Tian ordered
the Chaos Pearl to repair the heavens.

28:45.320 --> 28:47.480
Eventually, the Chaos Pearl
exhausted her spiritual power

28:47.560 --> 28:48.520
and fell into the human realm.

28:51.080 --> 28:52.960
After the Book of Fate
sensed the change in the Chaos Pearl,

28:54.080 --> 28:56.200
half of its soul
followed her to the human world,

28:56.720 --> 29:00.720
and the other half manifested a prophecy.

29:01.720 --> 29:03.920
The divine child is born.
The immortals fall.

29:04.000 --> 29:04.840
THE DIVINE CHILD IS BORN
THE IMMORTALS FALL

29:05.480 --> 29:06.560
The new Immortal Emperor, Jun Yu,

29:06.640 --> 29:08.480
did not understand
what the divine child was

29:08.560 --> 29:11.440
and asked the Book of Fate
for more information.

29:11.520 --> 29:13.560
But the Book of Fate was silent.

29:13.640 --> 29:16.720
Jun Yu ordered Anger Demon,
Desire Demon, and Ignorance Demon

29:16.800 --> 29:19.560
to stir up the human world
and search for the divine child.

29:20.440 --> 29:21.600
The Book of Fate
finally found the Chaos Pearl

29:21.680 --> 29:23.520
in the human realm,

29:24.040 --> 29:26.360
placed it in a pond in the Humans' palace,

29:26.440 --> 29:28.480
and nourished it with the Emperor's power,

29:29.000 --> 29:31.680
waiting for it to take human form again.

29:32.920 --> 29:37.080
10,000 YEARS AGO, DONGZE PALACE

29:41.320 --> 29:44.880
EMPEROR ZHAO MING

30:35.400 --> 30:37.560
The pearl is quite amusing.

30:38.080 --> 30:39.440
Your Majesty. Your Majesty.

30:40.160 --> 30:41.280
-Your Majesty.
-What's up?

30:41.800 --> 30:44.040
Yan has returned
and is waiting at Everbright Palace.

30:44.760 --> 30:46.400
The Xilin's infestation has been resolved.

30:47.000 --> 30:48.880
The king of Xilin has personally
sacrificed a hundred maidens

30:48.960 --> 30:52.280
to the West River in thanksgiving.

30:52.880 --> 30:54.360
The occurrence and timing
of this infestation was bizarre.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.440
YAN

30:55.520 --> 30:58.200
We found out
that it was related to a divine edict.

31:01.520 --> 31:03.320
The Divine Clan feeds on faith.

31:04.200 --> 31:06.680
They create fear before bestowing favors

31:07.480 --> 31:09.400
and make beings
bow down to and worship them

31:10.080 --> 31:11.680
in order to gain faith.

31:11.760 --> 31:13.520
These so-called divine edicts

31:14.840 --> 31:16.640
are merely the means of the Divine Clan.

31:17.160 --> 31:19.000
His Majesty
is the recognized leader of the world,

31:19.080 --> 31:21.360
so how could the king of Xilin
not report the divine edict?

31:21.440 --> 31:23.600
Your Majesty has always been
against human sacrifice,

31:23.680 --> 31:26.200
so the king of Xilin
did not dare to report it.

31:26.280 --> 31:29.160
The plague of Xilin has been removed,
but the people have missed the harvest,

31:29.240 --> 31:30.880
so some of the hungry
have joined the bandits,

31:31.400 --> 31:32.520
causing friction along the borders.

31:35.840 --> 31:38.200
We need to distinguish
between the people and the army.

31:38.720 --> 31:40.360
We need to be prepared
in advance for everything.

31:41.440 --> 31:43.760
I'll reconsider what happened in Xilin.

31:43.840 --> 31:44.800
Thank you, Yan.

31:44.880 --> 31:46.200
Get some rest.

31:47.120 --> 31:49.600
He works hard,
but not as hard as Your Majesty,

31:49.680 --> 31:52.520
and you haven't slept in days
because of government affairs.

31:52.600 --> 31:54.200
It's you who wants to sleep, isn't it?

31:55.440 --> 31:56.280
That's enough.

31:56.800 --> 31:58.840
I don't need anyone here. Go.

31:59.360 --> 32:00.200
Thank you, Your Majesty.

32:01.160 --> 32:03.080
Yan. Wait.

32:03.600 --> 32:05.760
We haven't seen each other for so long,
but is this how you treat your friends?

32:07.720 --> 32:10.800
You're from Xilin, and I'm from Dongze,

32:10.880 --> 32:12.600
but we see each other every day.

32:13.120 --> 32:16.560
By the way, did you see
anything interesting back there?

32:16.640 --> 32:18.000
Is that your only concern?

32:20.320 --> 32:23.920
Have you noticed that His Majesty
has been under so much pressure lately

32:24.440 --> 32:26.160
that he's even started
playing with a pearl?

32:26.240 --> 32:27.920
What does it matter to you?

32:29.480 --> 32:31.800
Except in the presence of His Majesty,
you're always boring.

32:31.880 --> 32:36.440
GRACEFUL PALACE

32:54.720 --> 32:58.800
THE SAINT EMPEROR'S ADVISOR

33:07.480 --> 33:09.840
The surroundings have always been good,

33:11.720 --> 33:13.760
and now, so are the people.

33:17.480 --> 33:19.440
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

33:24.040 --> 33:25.120
-Sir.
-Sir.

33:33.240 --> 33:34.480
You're just in time.

33:35.400 --> 33:36.920
Things have been turbulent lately.

33:37.000 --> 33:39.160
Yan went to a neighboring country
to gather some divine edict,

33:39.800 --> 33:41.360
so please enlighten me.

33:42.120 --> 33:45.440
I'm here to congratulate Your Majesty

33:46.200 --> 33:48.520
on acquiring the ancient divine artifact.

33:48.600 --> 33:50.120
Your ambitions are about to be realized.

33:50.960 --> 33:51.800
Divine artifact?

33:55.000 --> 33:58.160
The pearl in your hand
is the ancient divine artifact,

33:58.760 --> 33:59.920
the Chaos Pearl.

34:02.080 --> 34:04.520
The Chaos Power can open up
the heavens and the earth.

34:04.600 --> 34:05.720
If you succeed in refining it,

34:05.800 --> 34:08.679
you will be able to fight
the Divine Clan with ease.

34:11.960 --> 34:13.480
This is the Chaos Pearl.

34:14.679 --> 34:15.560
Please guide me.

34:17.159 --> 34:19.280
You're the only mortal

34:19.360 --> 34:21.840
in the history of Humans
born with divine channels,

34:22.440 --> 34:25.679
so your blood essence
can repair the Divine artifact.

34:25.760 --> 34:29.239
But if you lose a soul,

34:29.320 --> 34:30.679
-then…
-Don't worry.

34:31.199 --> 34:32.800
Can you help me with this?

34:58.240 --> 35:00.360
Your Majesty. Please.

35:30.520 --> 35:31.880
-Your Majesty.
-Don't worry.

35:43.440 --> 35:46.920
After ten years in the mortal world,
you're finally back.

35:51.920 --> 35:56.480
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

36:47.080 --> 36:51.240
PEARL

36:57.920 --> 36:59.160
Who are you?

37:00.240 --> 37:01.120
I'm Zhao Ming.

37:12.080 --> 37:13.240
I remember you.

37:17.920 --> 37:21.160
Your scent is familiar.

37:22.040 --> 37:23.000
What else do you remember?

37:25.080 --> 37:28.800
I remember that I seemed to be a pearl

37:29.920 --> 37:32.000
and was often held in your hand.

37:33.800 --> 37:35.480
I don't remember

37:37.240 --> 37:38.200
anything else.

37:40.880 --> 37:42.120
If you can't remember, just give up.

37:45.080 --> 37:46.520
Since you're a pearl,

37:46.600 --> 37:49.080
I'll call you Pearl from now on, okay?

37:49.160 --> 37:50.520
Pearl?

37:54.000 --> 37:55.400
I like that name.

37:58.800 --> 37:59.880
What are your future plans?

38:01.920 --> 38:03.440
Aren't I your Pearl?

38:11.720 --> 38:13.800
It's good to be like before.

38:14.440 --> 38:15.960
Now that you've taken human form,

38:16.480 --> 38:18.640
it would be a pity for you
to be confined to the palace.

38:20.040 --> 38:23.160
Would you like to travel the world
and see great landscapes?

38:27.720 --> 38:29.360
Will you come with me?

38:31.680 --> 38:32.960
I'm afraid not.

38:34.240 --> 38:35.600
I have to stay here.

38:38.240 --> 38:40.000
If you don't, neither do I.

38:40.800 --> 38:43.080
You're the only person
I know in the world,

38:43.160 --> 38:45.520
so I just want to stay with you.

38:46.360 --> 38:49.040
Besides, you have spiritual power,

38:49.120 --> 38:51.720
so I won't turn back
into a pearl around you.

38:52.640 --> 38:55.880
If you want to change your mind,
you can leave anytime.

39:04.000 --> 39:04.960
It's late.

39:06.120 --> 39:09.200
Yes, it is.

39:09.880 --> 39:12.120
I've had the Graceful Palace cleaned.

39:12.880 --> 39:14.080
You can go and rest now.

39:23.440 --> 39:26.840
It's time for you to rest. You look tired.

39:29.360 --> 39:30.800
Let's rest together.

39:43.960 --> 39:46.720
We can't sleep together.

39:47.360 --> 39:48.320
Why not?

39:48.840 --> 39:50.360
We slept together before.

39:51.040 --> 39:52.320
You're human now.

39:54.560 --> 39:57.880
Pearls can, but I can't.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.040
I'm not even as good as a pearl,

40:03.840 --> 40:07.000
but I'm not used to it and can't sleep

40:07.520 --> 40:08.600
if you're not with me.

40:16.560 --> 40:17.800
It's late today.

40:18.560 --> 40:19.880
Sleep here for now.

40:20.840 --> 40:22.160
I have a lot of paperwork to finish.

40:24.760 --> 40:25.920
I'm not leaving.

40:26.840 --> 40:28.040
I'll stay here.

40:34.560 --> 40:35.400
OK.

41:12.600 --> 41:13.680
Sir.

41:13.760 --> 41:14.840
It's cold tonight,

41:14.920 --> 41:17.680
so if you want to go to the garden,
remember to wear a cloak.

41:24.320 --> 41:25.440
I won't go there anymore.

41:27.680 --> 41:31.640
You said the garden pond
holds the essence of the sun and the moon.

41:32.240 --> 41:33.760
The spiritual energy collected there

41:33.840 --> 41:36.360
helps to refine
the rare spiritual essence.

41:36.440 --> 41:37.760
You used to go there every night,

41:38.560 --> 41:40.000
but now you don't want to go.

41:41.520 --> 41:43.280
Is it because your spiritual essence
has already been refined?

41:46.160 --> 41:47.400
The essence of the sun and the moon

41:47.480 --> 41:49.320
is certainly beneficial
to the refining of the spiritual essence,

41:49.400 --> 41:51.360
but the cycle is very long.

41:51.920 --> 41:55.800
I have recently discovered
another essence in this world

41:55.880 --> 41:57.720
that can help the spiritual essence
to be refined quickly.

41:59.040 --> 42:00.200
Really?

42:01.680 --> 42:04.760
But alchemy is about balance.

42:05.520 --> 42:06.560
If we rush it,

42:06.640 --> 42:09.120
we'll only void the spiritual essence.

42:13.240 --> 42:14.600
Thanks for the advice.

42:16.160 --> 42:19.360
You're right. The key to alchemy is heat.

42:21.720 --> 42:24.000
Sir, I'll go to the alchemy room.

42:27.640 --> 42:29.080
The Emperor's energy

42:29.160 --> 42:31.120
is greater than the essence
of the sun and moon.

42:31.200 --> 42:34.880
Soon, you'll be as good as new.
